# Error reports go to /api/log (functions/api/log.ts), which forwards them to
# New Relic with the Pages secret NEW_RELIC_LICENSE_KEY (Cloudflare Pages >
# Settings > Variables and Secrets, type Secret, no VITE_ prefix). It never
# reaches the browser bundle, and `pnpm build` fails if a New Relic key does.
# Local dev needs no key: reporting is off outside production builds, and the
# Function forwards only on molviewer.bio.
#
# VITE_ERROR_REPORTING=off turns reporting off in a production build.
